## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/monotoheightfield.html
- Summary (EN): Turns a mono layer into a heightfield. It changes the layer's type info to height and rescales and shifts the incoming values.
- Résumé (FR) : Transforme un calque mono en champ de hauteur en changeant son type d'information, puis en le remettant à l'échelle et en le décalant avec deux paramètres.

- Inputs meaning: ["mono: the original mono layer to convert", "height: listed under Inputs on the page but described as the resulting heightfield, so it appears to be the output and the page is ambiguous"]

- Key parameters: ["Height Scale: multiplies the height values so they convert to proper world-space locations", "Height Offset: adds a fixed amount to the height values"]

- Caveats: ["The page gives no explicit warnings or limitations.", "The height connector is ambiguous on the page: it is listed as an input but described as the output."]

